      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLD STRIPES (3) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 5th (22.83) at this track. Comes through a solid form race last start. Better than last start and worth following up. CRUISING NAT (8) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (22.82) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from seven starts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. CHIEF HAMISH (5) finished third (22.79) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Can figure in the finish. DOONGALLA BOY (1) can fill a top-three spot.",
